# Disable automatic setup in JusPrin

JusPrin starts at Home even when its configuration is absent or only default printer profiles exist. The shell disables automatic configuration setup after successful installation. It preserves the previous setting and restores it on uninstall or main-window destruction. Manual `run_wizard` calls remain unchanged, including the printer panel's manual setup path. A disabled or failed shell retains the default Orca startup behavior.

